  "about_item": [
    "Multi-functional Pet Brush: This dog bath brush features a built-in shampoo dispensing design, serving as essential dog bath supplies for effective pet grooming. It not only cleans your pets quickly and thoroughly but also massages the skin to boost blood circulation, leaving your furry friend relaxed and refreshed.",
    "Ergonomic Design: This square pet brush features a specially designed non-slip handle for a comfortable and secure grip while bathing your pet. Simply squeeze gently to dispense shampoo smoothly, helping you save more pet shampoo during grooming",
